Running an exec script from the edit mode minibuffer should run against
the currently focused buffer.

-- config --
path: tests/data/config/without-fsys.toml
-- file-hello.txt --
hello, world!
-- actions --
# Open the edit mode minibuffer and type the command
type: .
type: , x/world/ c/sailor/\n
-- buffer-list --
1    * hello.txt
-- expected-windows --
1
-- expected-buffer-1 --
hello, sailor!
